Gone.","s":330.45,"e":331.27,"line":127},{"w":"Alice","s":331.27,"e":331.85,"line":128},{"w":"doesn't","s":331.85,"e":332.65,"line":128},{"w":"follow.","s":332.65,"e":333.45,"line":128},{"w":"She","s":333.45,"e":333.81,"line":129},{"w":"smiles","s":333.81,"e":334.54,"line":129},{"w":"to","s":334.54,"e":334.78,"line":129},{"w":"herself","s":334.78,"e":335.63,"line":129},{"w":"and","s":335.63,"e":335.97,"line":130},{"w":"whispers:","s":335.97,"e":336.98,"line":130},{"w":"“The","s":336.98,"e":337.45,"line":131},{"w":"rabbit","s":337.45,"e":338.17,"line":131},{"w":"is","s":338.17,"e":338.41,"line":131},{"w":"only","s":338.41,"e":338.89,"line":131},{"w":"a","s":338.89,"e":339.13,"line":131},{"w":"rabbit.”","s":339.13,"e":340.09,"line":131},{"w":"Three","s":340.09,"e":340.68,"line":132},{"w":"steps","s":340.68,"e":341.27,"line":132},{"w":"toward","s":341.27,"e":341.98,"line":132},{"w":"home.","s":341.98,"e":342.57,"line":132},{"w":"Then,","s":342.57,"e":343.17,"line":133},{"w":"under","s":343.17,"e":343.77,"line":133},{"w":"her","s":343.77,"e":344.12,"line":133},{"w":"breath—","s":344.12,"e":344.96,"line":133},{"w":"“But","s":344.96,"e":345.44,"line":134},{"w":"nobody","s":345.44,"e":346.16,"line":134},{"w":"ever","s":346.16,"e":346.64,"line":134},{"w":"asked","s":346.64,"e":347.24,"line":134},{"w":"what","s":347.24,"e":347.73,"line":135},{"w":"the","s":347.73,"e":348.09,"line":135},{"w":"rabbit","s":348.09,"e":348.83,"line":135},{"w":"thinks","s":348.83,"e":349.56,"line":135},{"w":"of","s":349.56,"e":349.8,"line":135},{"w":"Alice.”","s":349.8,"e":350.66,"line":135}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":6.59,"text":"White walls, white shoes, white clock with no hands,"},{"s":6.59,"e":10.94,"text":"They keep asking Alice if she understands."},{"s":10.94,"e":14.99,"text":"A paper cup moon and a fluorescent sun,"},{"s":14.99,"e":17.27,"text":"Door locks behind her—"},{"s":17.27,"e":19.34,"text":"“Treatment’s begun.”"},{"s":19.34,"e":23.9,"text":"Doctor with a clipboard, kindness rehearsed,"},{"s":23.9,"e":30.02,"text":"Says, “Tell me what you saw when the whole world reversed.”"},{"s":30.02,"e":35.51,"text":"Alice bites her tongue till she tastes something red,"},{"s":35.51,"e":37.69,"text":"“There was a rabbit.”"},{"s":37.69,"e":40.28,"text":"He circles what she said."},{"s":40.28,"e":42.87,"text":"“No tunnels. No kingdoms."},{"s":42.87,"e":45.57,"text":"No queen dressed in black."},{"s":45.57,"e":47.85,"text":"No watches, no voices,"},{"s":47.85,"e":50.34,"text":"No looking-glass cracks."},{"s":50.34,"e":52.41,"text":"You want to go home?"},{"s":52.41,"e":55,"text":"Then give us the answer.”"},{"s":55,"e":56.56,"text":"Alice whispers—"},{"s":56.56,"e":59.56,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":59.56,"e":62.47,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":62.47,"e":64.64,"text":"No message inside it,"},{"s":64.64,"e":66.82,"text":"No doorway behind it,"},{"s":66.82,"e":71.59,"text":"No reason on earth I should follow or grab it."},{"s":71.59,"e":74.6,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":74.6,"e":77.08,"text":"Say it like you mean it."},{"s":77.08,"e":79.36,"text":"Say it till it's true."},{"s":79.36,"e":81.65,"text":"Say it for the doctors"},{"s":81.65,"e":84.03,"text":"Who know more than you."},{"s":84.03,"e":87.14,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":87.14,"e":90.77,"text":"And maybe they'll give me my shoes."},{"s":90.77,"e":94.81,"text":"Tuesday tastes exactly like Monday did,"},{"s":94.81,"e":99.79,"text":"She counts ceiling tiles like a good little kid."},{"s":99.79,"e":104.76,"text":"Group room confession underneath buzzing lights:"},{"s":104.76,"e":107.04,"text":"“What is real, Alice?”"},{"s":107.04,"e":110.26,"text":"She says, “Whatever you write.”"},{"s":110.26,"e":115.86,"text":"The girl down the hallway says, “Don't fight the tide."},{"s":115.86,"e":120.52,"text":"They don't need you certain, just certified.”"},{"s":120.52,"e":125.6,"text":"Then she taps on the wall—three knocks, then two—"},{"s":125.6,"e":127.88,"text":"Alice hears scratching"},{"s":127.88,"e":129.33,"text":"From Room 302."},{"s":129.33,"e":131.92,"text":"“No tunnels. No kingdoms."},{"s":131.92,"e":134,"text":"No tea at half-past."},{"s":134,"e":136.8,"text":"The things that you dreamed"},{"s":136.8,"e":139.7,"text":"Are a symptom that's passed."},{"s":139.7,"e":142.39,"text":"You want your own clothes?"},{"s":142.39,"e":144.99,"text":"You want your old habits?"},{"s":144.99,"e":146.96,"text":"Then say it again.”"},{"s":146.96,"e":148.41,"text":"So Alice says—"},{"s":148.41,"e":151.41,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":151.41,"e":154.32,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":154.32,"e":157.01,"text":"Its eyes aren't a warning,"},{"s":157.01,"e":159.5,"text":"It doesn't know my name,"},{"s":159.5,"e":162.51,"text":"And clocks don't run backward"},{"s":162.51,"e":164.58,"text":"No matter the panic."},{"s":164.58,"e":167.58,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":167.58,"e":169.76,"text":"I know how to say it."},{"s":169.76,"e":172.04,"text":"I'm learning the tune."},{"s":172.04,"e":174.01,"text":"Morning medication,"},{"s":174.01,"e":175.57,"text":"Dinner at noon."},{"s":175.57,"e":178.68,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":178.68,"e":182.31,"text":"Now please let me out of this room."},{"s":182.31,"e":183.86,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":183.86,"e":185.42,"text":"Nothing to see."},{"s":185.42,"e":186.97,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":186.97,"e":188.53,"text":"Nothing but me."},{"s":188.53,"e":190.08,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":190.08,"e":191.84,"text":"Four little feet."},{"s":191.84,"e":194.23,"text":"Then why do I hear them"},{"s":194.23,"e":196.2,"text":"Running underneath?"},{"s":196.2,"e":201.07,"text":"Her mother comes Sunday with tears in her eyes,"},{"s":201.07,"e":206.05,"text":"Says, “Baby, just tell them whatever they like.”"},{"s":206.05,"e":211.54,"text":"Alice says, “What if pretending is part of the trap?”"},{"s":211.54,"e":214.44,"text":"Her mother squeezes tighter:"},{"s":214.44,"e":217.03,"text":"“Just get yourself back.”"},{"s":217.03,"e":218.69,"text":"But which Alice?"},{"s":218.69,"e":221.08,"text":"The one before falling?"},{"s":221.08,"e":223.15,"text":"The one after pills?"},{"s":223.15,"e":226.26,"text":"The one who stopped screaming?"},{"s":226.26,"e":228.54,"text":"The one sitting still?"},{"s":228.54,"e":230.82,"text":"If sanity's a password"},{"s":230.82,"e":232.69,"text":"Printed on a page,"},{"s":232.69,"e":234.97,"text":"Is freedom being free—"},{"s":234.97,"e":237.56,"text":"Or saying the right thing"},{"s":237.56,"e":240.26,"text":"To whoever holds the cage?"},{"s":240.26,"e":245.33,"text":"So Alice stands straight when the doctors arrive."},{"s":245.33,"e":247.41,"text":"Hair neatly brushed."},{"s":247.41,"e":248.65,"text":"Voice quiet."},{"s":248.65,"e":249.59,"text":"Eyes dry."},{"s":249.59,"e":252.07,"text":"“Do you understand now?”"},{"s":252.07,"e":253.21,"text":"She smiles."},{"s":253.21,"e":254.04,"text":"“I do.”"},{"s":254.04,"e":256.32,"text":"“What was the rabbit?”"},{"s":256.32,"e":257.46,"text":"“A rabbit.”"},{"s":257.46,"e":259.02,"text":"“Nothing more?”"},{"s":259.02,"e":260.57,"text":"“Nothing more.”"},{"s":260.57,"e":262.85,"text":"The pen makes a check."},{"s":262.85,"e":265.24,"text":"The lock makes a sound."},{"s":265.24,"e":267.83,"text":"And somewhere inside her,"},{"s":267.83,"e":270.63,"text":"Something goes underground."},{"s":270.63,"e":273.64,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":273.64,"e":276.54,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":276.54,"e":278.61,"text":"No prophecy, portal,"},{"s":278.61,"e":280.79,"text":"No beautiful madness,"},{"s":280.79,"e":284.94,"text":"No universe hiding inside of the static."},{"s":284.94,"e":287.94,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":287.94,"e":290.02,"text":"I said it correctly."},{"s":290.02,"e":292.09,"text":"You opened the door."},{"s":292.09,"e":294.58,"text":"You gave back my jacket,"},{"s":294.58,"e":296.86,"text":"My name, and my phone."},{"s":296.86,"e":299.76,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":299.76,"e":302.87,"text":"I don't chase rabbits anymore."},{"s":302.87,"e":305.46,"text":"She walks past reception."},{"s":305.46,"e":307.53,"text":"Past security glass."},{"s":307.53,"e":309.92,"text":"Past the sign that says"},{"s":309.92,"e":312.1,"text":"RECOVERY IS POSSIBLE."},{"s":312.1,"e":312.93,"text":"Outside—"},{"s":312.93,"e":314.17,"text":"October air."},{"s":314.17,"e":315,"text":"Cars."},{"s":315,"e":315.83,"text":"People."},{"s":315.83,"e":317.59,"text":"Ordinary morning."},{"s":317.59,"e":319.87,"text":"Alice closes her eyes."},{"s":319.87,"e":320.8,"text":"Breathes."},{"s":320.8,"e":321.94,"text":"Opens them."},{"s":321.94,"e":324.33,"text":"Across the parking lot,"},{"s":324.33,"e":325.88,"text":"Something white"},{"s":325.88,"e":327.96,"text":"slips behind a tree."},{"s":327.96,"e":329.41,"text":"Two long ears."},{"s":329.41,"e":330.45,"text":"A flicker."},{"s":330.45,"e":331.27,"text":"Gone."},{"s":331.27,"e":333.45,"text":"Alice doesn't follow."},{"s":333.45,"e":335.63,"text":"She smiles to herself"},{"s":335.63,"e":336.98,"text":"and whispers:"},{"s":336.98,"e":340.09,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":340.09,"e":342.57,"text":"Three steps toward home."},{"s":342.57,"e":344.96,"text":"Then, under her breath—"},{"s":344.96,"e":347.24,"text":"“But nobody ever asked"},{"s":347.24,"e":350.66,"text":"what the rabbit thinks of Alice.”"}],"duration":351.16,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}